        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n51" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;One person may hold more than one role, and on small pieces of work often will. A role may be held by a team or a committee rather than by one person, in which case one named individual carries the accountability for it. The exception is the analyst and the assurer, who are separate in all cases. Every card here is written out in the text description below the picture, and section 13 is how to find out who currently holds each post.&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#231F20;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="912" y="990" width="848" height="140" as="geometry" />
